I've determined that the `nextStartTime` variable, used for sequential audio, is causing desynchronization because it's global and can delay audio relative to the video when a full audio clip is played. The 50ms `setTimeout` in `GreetingCard` adds to this. I'm focusing on modifying the audio playback logic and synchronization in the `GreetingCard` component to ensure they start at the same time to solve the problem.


